/* GOLDEN REFERENCE — the discovery classifier replayed over REAL frames from
 * reac-captures, byte-verbatim:
 *
 *   matrix-m200-s4000-coldconnect-2026-07-24.pcap
 *     M-200 (00:40:ab:c9:cc:03) + S-4000S unit 00:40:ab:c4:08:bc, 48 k, a
 *     WORKING cold-connect: the box walks the full 0014/0013/0016/001a
 *     escalation and the master hunts, grants, heartbeats and streams
 *     head-amp records around it.
 *   matrix-m5000-s4000-unit1-coldconnect-2026-07-11.pcap
 *     M-5000 (00:40:ab:ca:15:4c) + S-4000S unit 00:40:ab:c4:06:80.
 *
 * Each entry is frame[0:50] (eth header + counter + type word + the 32-byte
 * control block — everything reac_disco_classify reads) plus the frame's real
 * wire length, and the verdict the classifier must reach. The audio region is
 * not stored: the block checksum covers [18:50] only, so a zero-filled tail
 * classifies identically to the captured frame.
 *
 * What this pins (arbitration spec 2026-08-20 §4, issue #90):
 *   - the box cold-connect ESCALATION (0014 -> 0013 -> 0016 -> 001a, sel 00 02)
 *     is BOX evidence in all four steps — 0016/001a used to file as a rival
 *     master, which is exactly the "master, no model" misfile the failed
 *     m5000/96k join showed;
 *   - an uncaptured cdea 01 declaration (01 03 000d here) classifies UNKNOWN —
 *     a frame kind nobody has captured must not be able to flip the segment's
 *     topology;
 *   - a head-amp record (04 03 0013, TAG 01 01) is MASTER evidence — only a
 *     console emits preamp records (m200-headamp-re/DECODE.md; x204 in this
 *     capture);
 *   - both S-4000 units' config-announce blocks are byte-identical to the
 *     s4000s model row — measured across all four S-4000 captures on 2026-08-20;
 *     the model table already covers the merge/split units.
 *
 * KNOWN AMBIGUITY, deliberately NOT pinned: the master's grant echo
 * (04 03 0014, TAG 01 00, sel 00 02 — x4 in this capture) is byte-identical to
 * a box's 0014 join and files as BOX. No per-frame signature can split them;
 * direction resolution is the sighting table's job (arbitration increment 2).
 * Pinning the misfile as "expected" would ratchet a lie.
 *
 * Regenerate: dump frame[0:50] of the named packets with
 * reac-captures/analysis/reac_pcap.py (offsets per reac_ctrl.c: counter@14,
 * type@16, op@18/19, op_len@20-21 BE, sel/sel2@22/23). */

struct s4000_gold {
	uint16_t    len;         /* real wire length (frames carry the OHRCA +2) */
	uint8_t     head[50];    /* frame[0:50], byte-verbatim from the capture  */
	int         role;        /* enum reac_disco_role the sighting must carry */
	const char *model;       /* expected model token; NULL = must stay unidentified */
};

